        "created_at": "2014-07-11T15:48:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Silverleaf\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/48/2332_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Silverleaf:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>lynkfox wrote:</b><br>\n<blockquote>Silverleaf wrote:<br>\n<blockquote>No-one would have gotten out of my school alive with the name Felicia.I guess it's from the Latin for happy or lucky, but it sounds like something else...Saying that though, anyone who could tell you what a name means in Latin probably wouldn't last too long either. \n</blockquote>\n<p>Are YOU going to bully the girl with Atomic Laser Eye Sight an Super Strength who can fly and see through buildings???</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<p>You don’t know my school.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Oo</p>",
