        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yeah, they don't even wear masks or glasses or anything :D.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I'd love to see the \"But Superman doesn't wear glasses\" conversation for this.<br><br>\"I'm telling you, Paul Parsons is Legacy.\"<br><br>\"He can't be Legacy, Paul doesn't wear that costume!\"<br><br>\"… You can't be that stupid…\"</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Though, do we ever see Paul Parsons out of costume?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I always assumed he was like Captain America anyways, publicly known figure.</p>",
